#: plinius-greeter:256
msgid "A PIN has 4 to 12 digits."
msgstr "Un PIN ha da 4 a 12 cifre."

#: plinius-greeter:258
msgid "The PINs do not match. Please enter it again."
msgstr "I PIN non coincidono. Inseriscilo di nuovo."

#: plinius-greeter:262
msgid "A password has at least 6 characters."
msgstr "Una password ha almeno 6 caratteri."

#: plinius-greeter:264
msgid "A password of digits only is a PIN: choose PIN above."
msgstr "Una password di sole cifre è un PIN: scegli PIN qui sopra."

#: plinius-greeter:266
msgid "The passwords do not match. Please enter them again."
msgstr "Le password non coincidono. Inseriscile di nuovo."

#: plinius-greeter:323 plinius-greeter:692
msgid "Who is using the phone?"
msgstr "Chi usa il telefono?"

#: plinius-greeter:325 plinius-greeter:693
msgid "Tap your account, then unlock it as usual."
msgstr "Tocca il tuo account, poi sbloccalo come sempre."

#: plinius-greeter:415
msgid "Protect your phone"
msgstr "Proteggi il tuo telefono"

#: plinius-greeter:416
msgid ""
"Choose how to unlock it. Settings and every other question for the password "
"ask for the same."
msgstr "Scegli come sbloccarlo. Le Impostazioni e ogni altra richiesta di password chiedono lo stesso."

#: plinius-greeter:467
msgid "PIN"
msgstr "PIN"

#: plinius-greeter:468 plinius-greeter:501
msgid "Password"
msgstr "Password"

#: plinius-greeter:487
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Cancella"

#: plinius-greeter:490 plinius-greeter:507
msgid "Continue"
msgstr "Continua"

#: plinius-greeter:502
msgid "Repeat password"
msgstr "Ripeti password"

#: plinius-greeter:528
msgid "Repeat the PIN."
msgstr "Ripeti il PIN."

#: plinius-greeter:529
msgid "Choose a PIN of 4 to 12 digits."
msgstr "Scegli un PIN da 4 a 12 cifre."

#: plinius-greeter:532
msgid "Choose a password of at least 6 characters."
msgstr "Scegli una password di almeno 6 caratteri."

#: plinius-greeter:610 plinius-greeter:623 plinius-greeter:643
msgid "The password could not be set. Please try again."
msgstr "Impossibile impostare la password. Riprova."

#: plinius-greeter:613
msgid "Setting it up…"
msgstr "Configurazione…"

#: plinius-greeter:635 plinius-greeter:663
msgid "Starting…"
msgstr "Avvio…"

#: plinius-greeter:638
msgid ""
"That is the password of the encryption. Choose another one: it is typed in "
"view of others many times a day."
msgstr "È la password della cifratura. Scegline un’altra: si digita davanti ad altri molte volte al giorno."

#: plinius-greeter:641
msgid ""
"That cannot be used. A PIN has 4 to 12 digits, a password at least 6 "
"characters."
msgstr "Non si può usare. Un PIN ha da 4 a 12 cifre, una password almeno 6 caratteri."

#: plinius-greeter:695
msgid "The phone could not start this account. Please try again."
msgstr "Il telefono non è riuscito ad avviare questo account. Riprova."

#. Translators: the date below the clock (GLib's strftime codes), e.g. "%A, %-d. %B" in German
#: plinius-greeter:717
msgid "%A, %B %-d"
msgstr "%A %-d %B"

#: plinius-greeter:724
msgid "_Cancel"
msgstr "_Annulla"

#: plinius-greeter:725
msgid "_Restart"
msgstr "_Riavvia"

#: plinius-greeter:726
msgid "_Power Off"
msgstr "_Spegni"
